        class="text-sm font-medium text-white hover:text-indigo-400 transition flex items-center gap-1"
      >
        <span>🧮</span> Calculator
      </a>
      <a
        href="/blog/"
        class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-300 hover:text-white transition"
      >Blog</a>
      <a
